# Monitoring Architecture

The CNAS monitoring architecture provides centralised metrics, alerting,
dashboard visualisation and log management for the Kubernetes application. It
covers end-to-end application and Gateway availability, scalability, resource
utilisation, MySQL and Redis health, Kubernetes node health, and workload logs.

The deployable configuration and current limitations are documented in
`k8s/observability/README.md`; the installation and evidence procedure is in
`docs/DEMO-RUNBOOK.md`.

